function legacyRecord(){return pageHead('病历编辑与全周期质控','门诊病历 · 草稿 v4 · 模板：心内科门诊 v2.3','<button class="btn">查看版本</button><button class="btn primary">提交审签</button>')+patientStrip()+`<div class="grid cols-3" style="grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr) 320px"><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">文书大纲 <span class="sub">完成 86%</span></div><div class="card-body"><div class="progress"><span style="width:86%"></span></div>${['主诉 ✓','现病史 ✓','既往史 ✓','体格检查 ✓','辅助检查 △','诊断 ✓','治疗计划 △','复诊计划'].map((x,i)=>`<div class="queue-item ${i===1?'active':''}"><div class="queue-title">${x}</div><div class="queue-meta">${i===4?'缺少关键结果':i===6?'需确认剂量':'已完成'}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></aside><section class="card scroll-card"><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn sm"><b>B</b></button><button class="btn sm"><i>I</i></button><button class="btn sm">结构化字段</button><button class="btn sm">插入结果</button><span class="grow"></span><span class="status green">自动保存正常</span></div><div class="card-body" style="padding:24px 34px"><h2 style="text-align:center;margin-top:0">门诊病历</h2><p class="meta" style="text-align:center">江城大学附属医院 · 心血管内科</p><hr style="border:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);margin:18px 0"><div class="form-row"><div class="label">主诉</div><div class="field">头晕、血压升高 1 周</div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">现病史</div><div class="field textarea ai">患者一周前无明显诱因出现头晕，自测血压最高 168/96 mmHg，无胸痛、黑矇及意识丧失。规律服用氨氯地平 5mg qd。<span class="source-tag">AI 草稿已编辑</span></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">辅助检查</div><div class="field" style="border-color:#e4a13c;background:#fffbf2">肾功能：2026-08-06 正常。<br><span style="color:var(--amber);font-size:11px">△ 缺少本次血钾结果，开具相关药物前建议补充</span></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">治疗计划</div><div class="field textarea">继续氨氯地平 5mg qd，监测家庭血压；根据复查结果评估联合用药。</div></div></div><div class="footer-actions"><span class="save-state">● 草稿 v4 · 09:22 保存</span><button class="btn">退出编辑</button><button class="btn primary">签署前检查</button></div></section><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">质控与来源 <span class="status amber">3 项</span></div><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active">问题</button><button class="tab">来源</button><button class="tab">历史</button></div><div class="card-body"><div class="notice hard"><div class="notice-title">阻断 · 必填缺失</div>复诊计划未填写。签署前必须完成。<br><button class="btn sm" style="margin-top:7px">定位字段</button></div><div class="notice rule"><div class="notice-title">机构规则 · 待处理</div>如调整 RAAS 类药物，应记录近期血钾和肾功能。<br><button class="btn sm" style="margin-top:7px">查看依据</button></div><div class="notice ai"><div class="notice-title">AI 建议 · 非阻断</div>“规律服药”与患者自述“偶有漏服”可能存在矛盾。<br><button class="btn sm" style="margin-top:7px">查看两处来源</button> <button class="btn sm">驳回</button></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:18px">AI 内容统计</div><div class="bar-row"><span>已人工确认</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:78%;background:#198754"></span></div><b>78%</b></div><div class="bar-row"><span>已编辑</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:18%;background:#8b5cf6"></span></div><b>18%</b></div><div class="bar-row"><span>待确认</span><div class="bar"><span style="width:4%;background:#e89b13"></span></div><b>4%</b></div></div></aside></div>`}
function opdDiagnosis(){const dx=[['原发性高血压 2级（很高危）','I10.x03','主诊断','已确认','green'],['颈动脉粥样硬化','I65.2','其他诊断','历史沿用','blue'],['体位性低血压？','I95.1','鉴别诊断','待排除','amber']];return pageHead('门诊诊断与问题清单','本次就诊诊断、鉴别诊断和长期问题分别管理','<button class="btn">查看历史诊断</button><button class="btn primary">保存诊断</button>')+patientStrip()+`<div class="grid secondary-grid"><section class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">本次诊断 <span class="sub">3 项</span></div><div class="toolbar"><input class="search" placeholder="诊断名称、拼音或 ICD-10"><button class="btn primary">＋ 添加</button></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>诊断名称</th><th>编码</th><th>类型</th><th>状态</th><th>顺序</th></tr></thead><tbody>${dx.map((x,i)=>`<tr><td><b>${x[0]}</b></td><td>${x[1]}</td><td>${x[2]}</td><td><span class="status ${x[4]}">${x[3]}</span></td><td>${i+1}　⋮</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><div class="card-body"><div class="section-title">诊断依据</div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">主要依据</div><div class="field textarea">诊室血压 156/92 mmHg；近 3 月家庭血压多次超过 150/90 mmHg；既往已确诊高血压并规律治疗。</div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">鉴别计划</div><div class="field">卧立位血压、用药依从性核对；必要时完善动态血压监测。</div></div></div></section><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">编码、冲突与长期问题</div><div class="card-body"><div class="notice rule"><div class="notice-title">编码完整性</div>高血压危险分层已记录；尚需确认靶器官损害依据。</div><div class="notice ai"><div class="notice-title">✦ AI 鉴别建议</div>“起立后头晕”与降压药使用提示体位性低血压可能。仅作为鉴别项，不自动形成诊断。</div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">长期问题清单</div>${[['高血压','活动','green'],['冠状动脉粥样硬化','活动','green'],['青霉素严重过敏','永久','red'],['吸烟史','已戒 6 年','gray']].map(x=>`<div class="queue-item"><div class="queue-title">${x[0]}<span class="status ${x[2]}">${x[1]}</span></div></div>`).join('')}<div class="notice info"><div class="notice-title">诊断签署规则</div>候选编码、AI 建议和历史诊断不会自动成为本次诊断；医生确认后绑定本次就诊和版本。</div></div></aside></div>`}
function opdOrders(){const rows=[['药品','氨氯地平片','5 mg · 口服 · qd · 14天','待审方','amber'],['药品','缬沙坦胶囊','80 mg · 口服 · qd · 14天','草稿','gray'],['检验','血钾、肾功能','急诊否 · 空腹否','已提交','blue'],['检查','动态血压监测','24小时','待预约','blue'],['治疗','高血压健康教育','本次门诊','待执行','gray']];return pageHead('门诊医嘱与处方','药品、检验、检查和治疗共用一条可追溯的开立—审核—执行主线','<button class="btn">常用医嘱集</button><button class="btn">费用试算</button><button class="btn primary">提交医嘱与处方</button>')+patientStrip()+`<div class="grid secondary-grid"><section class="card scroll-card"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active">全部 5</button><button class="tab">药品 2</button><button class="tab">检验 1</button><button class="tab">检查 1</button><button class="tab">治疗 1</button></div><div class="toolbar"><button class="btn primary">＋ 新增医嘱</button><button class="btn">引用医嘱集</button><button class="btn">成组</button><span class="grow"></span><span class="status green">重复提交保护已启用</span></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>类别</th><th>项目</th><th>剂量/要求</th><th>状态</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(x=>`<tr><td><span class="status blue">${x[0]}</span></td><td><b>${x[1]}</b></td><td>${x[2]}</td><td><span class="status ${x[4]}">${x[3]}</span></td><td><button class="btn sm">编辑</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><div class="card-body"><div class="section-title">当前选中 · 缬沙坦胶囊</div><div class="order-form"><div><span>单次剂量</span><b>80 mg</b></div><div><span>途径</span><b>口服</b></div><div><span>频次</span><b>每日一次</b></div><div><span>疗程</span><b>14 天</b></div><div><span>总量</span><b>14 粒</b></div><div><span>医保</span><b>甲类</b></div></div></div></section><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">处方审查与执行约束 <span class="status red">1 阻断</span></div><div class="card-body"><div class="notice hard"><div class="notice-title">血钾结果缺失</div>新增 RAAS 抑制剂前需确认近期血钾和肾功能。当前仅有 7 天前肾功能，无同期血钾。</div><div class="notice rule"><div class="notice-title">联合降压提示</div>请记录家庭血压、体位性症状和复诊监测计划。</div><div class="notice ai"><div class="notice-title">✦ AI 用药比较</div>已比较现用药、过敏、肾功能和既往不良反应；未发现明确禁忌，但不能替代药师审方。</div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">状态与责任</div>${[['处方开立','林医生','进行中'],['药师审方','门诊药房','待提交'],['患者缴费','收费窗口/线上','未开始'],['调剂发药','门诊药房','未开始']].map((x,i)=>`<div class="queue-item"><div class="queue-title">${x[0]}<span class="status ${i===0?'blue':'gray'}">${x[2]}</span></div><div class="queue-meta">责任：${x[1]}</div></div>`).join('')}</div></aside></div>`}
function opdResults(){const results=[['血压','156/92 mmHg','↑','诊室测量','09:02','amber'],['肌酐','78 μmol/L','正常','检验科','08-06','green'],['eGFR','78 ml/min','正常','检验科','08-06','green'],['血钾','—','未回','检验科','预计 10:20','gray'],['动态血压','待预约','—','心功能室','—','blue']];return pageHead('门诊检查检验与结果','按申请、执行、报告版本、趋势和临床确认管理结果','<button class="btn">全部历史趋势</button><button class="btn primary">确认已阅结果</button>')+patientStrip()+`<div class="grid secondary-grid"><section class="card scroll-card"><div class="toolbar"><select class="select"><option>本次就诊 + 近 90 天</option></select><select class="select"><option>全部结果状态</option></select><input class="search" placeholder="项目或报告结论"></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>项目</th><th>结果</th><th>标志</th><th>来源</th><th>时间</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${results.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${x[0]}</b></td><td>${x[1]}</td><td>${x[2]}</td><td>${x[3]}</td><td>${x[4]}</td><td><span class="status ${x[5]}">${x[5]==='gray'?'等待':x[5]==='blue'?'已申请':'已报告'}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><div class="card-body"><div class="section-title">血压趋势</div><div class="trend-chart"><div><b>168/96</b><span>07-01</span></div><i></i><div><b>158/94</b><span>07-21</span></div><i></i><div><b>148/88</b><span>08-06</span></div><i></i><div class="active"><b>156/92</b><span>今天</span></div></div><div class="notice info"><div class="notice-title">报告版本</div>结果更正后保留原报告、修订报告、更正原因、报告者和医生确认版本；趋势默认采用当前有效版本。</div></div></section><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">结果处置与待回访 <span class="status amber">2 项</span></div><div class="card-body"><div class="notice rule"><div class="notice-title">结果未齐</div>血钾尚未回报，含缬沙坦的处方不能提交审方。</div><div class="section-title">本次申请进度</div>${[['血钾/肾功能','已采血','09:31','blue'],['动态血压','待预约','今日','amber'],['高血压教育','待执行','诊后','gray']].map(x=>`<div class="queue-item"><div class="queue-title">${x[0]}<span class="status ${x[3]}">${x[1]}</span></div><div class="queue-meta">${x[2]}</div></div>`).join('')}<div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">离院后结果</div><div class="notice info">若患者离院后报告返回，系统生成“门诊待回结果”任务，必须记录查看、联系患者、临床判断和后续安排。</div><button class="btn" style="width:100%">设置结果回访责任人</button></div></aside></div>`}
function opdConsult(){const consults=[['营养科','高血压饮食评估','普通','今日 09:24','待受理','amber'],['眼科','高血压视网膜病变筛查','普通','2026-07-21','已完成','green'],['心衰中心','既往心功能评估','普通','2026-05-18','已完成','green']];return pageHead('门诊会诊、转诊与协同','申请、受理、意见、执行和患者去向全程保留责任与时限','<button class="btn">转诊单</button><button class="btn primary">新建会诊申请</button>')+patientStrip()+`<div class="grid secondary-grid"><section class="card scroll-card"><div class="tabs"><button class="tab active">本次会诊</button><button class="tab">历史会诊</button><button class="tab">转诊记录</button></div><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>目的科室</th><th>申请目的</th><th>紧急度</th><th>申请时间</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody>${consults.map(x=>`<tr><td><b>${x[0]}</b></td><td>${x[1]}</td><td>${x[2]}</td><td>${x[3]}</td><td><span class="status ${x[5]}">${x[4]}</span></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table><div class="card-body"><div class="section-title">营养科会诊申请</div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">临床问题</div><div class="field textarea">高血压控制欠佳，BMI 27.8 kg/m²，请评估钠摄入、体重管理和可执行饮食方案。</div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">期望完成</div><div class="field">今日 16:00 前 · 门诊协同</div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="label">患者状态</div><div class="field">已知情，可在诊后前往营养门诊</div></div></div></section><aside class="card scroll-card"><div class="card-head">时限、意见和转诊</div><div class="card-body"><div class="notice rule"><div class="notice-title">会诊尚未受理</div>剩余 5 小时 42 分；超时自动通知营养科负责人和申请医生。</div><div class="section-title">既往眼科意见</div><div class="approval-box"><b>未见明显高血压视网膜病变</b><p class="meta">建议血压达标后 12 个月复查；意见已由眼科周医生签署。</p><button class="btn sm">查看签署来源</button></div><div class="section-title" style="margin-top:16px">转诊安全信息</div>${['患者身份与联系方式','本次病情摘要和诊断','当前用药与严重过敏','已回/待回结果','转诊目的和紧急度','接收机构与患者知情'].map(x=>`<div class="folder-row">✓ ${x}<span>已准备</span></div>`).join('')}<button class="btn primary" style="width:100%;margin-top:12px">生成转诊摘要草稿</button></div></aside></div>`}
